    "text": "WhatsApp parser is done. A day after my \"kal tak\", sorry. Handles iOS + Android, 12h/24h, multi-line messages, media placeholders. Tested on both our groups.\n```\nconst IOS = /^\\[(\\d{1,2}\\/\\d{1,2}\\/\\d{2,4}), (\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}(?::\\d{2})?\\s?[AP]?M?)\\] ([^:]+): (.*)$/;\nconst ANDROID = /^(\\d{1,2}\\/\\d{1,2}\\/\\d{2,4}), (\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}\\s?[ap]?m?) - ([^:]+): (.*)$/;\n```",
